  "fullDescription": "DESCRIPTION\n\nCreate warm and adorable autumn-themed designs with this Cute Cozy Autumn Clipart Bundle. This collection includes 36 hand-drawn high-quality PNG files with transparent backgrounds, perfect for stickers, sublimation, scrapbooking, planners, invitations, mugs, t-shirts, and many other creative projects.\n\nThis cozy kawaii collection features charming autumn coffee cups, hot cocoa, books, pumpkin pie, cinnamon rolls, pumpkins, teapots, woodland animals, autumn leaves, acorns, watering cans, cozy scarves, blankets, berries, and other seasonal fall elements in soft pastel colors.\n\nIncluded:\n\n• 36 individual PNG files\n\n• High resolution 300 DPI\n\n• Transparent background\n\n• Hand-drawn illustrations\n\n• Soft pastel autumn color palette\n\n• Ready for personal and commercial projects\n\nPerfect For:\n\n• Stickers\n\n• Sticker sheets\n\n• Sublimation\n\n• T-shirts\n\n• Scrapbooking\n\n• Journals and planners\n\n• Invitations\n\n• Printable crafts\n\n• Greeting cards\n\n• Party decorations\n\n• Cricut and Silhouette projects\n\n• Seasonal home decor\n\n─────────────────\n\nCOMMERCIAL USE INCLUDED\n\nThese illustrations may be used to create physical and digital end products, including stickers, sticker sheets, mugs, t-shirts, seamless patterns, sublimation designs, printable products, greeting cards, planners, journals, and other finished designs.\n\nPlease note:\n\n• Original PNG files may not be resold, shared, redistributed, or claimed as your own.\n\n• Files may not be sold, uploaded, or redistributed as standalone clipart, digital papers, or clipart bundles.\n\n• You may use the artwork to create your own products and finished designs for sale.\n\n• Only the original files themselves may not be resold or redistributed.\n\n────────────────────\n\nThank you so much for visiting my shop and supporting my artwork!\n\nI hope you enjoy creating beautiful projects with these cozy autumn illustrations. If you have any questions or need assistance, please feel free to contact me. I’d be happy to help.\n\nIf you love this design, please consider leaving a review and following my shop for more cute clipart collections and future updates.\n\nThank you for your support, and happy creating!\n\n♥\n\n⸻",
